### Analyze the bundled MA101 session with a too-small room proposal
POST http://localhost:5000/api/conflicts/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./conflict_analyze.json

### Generate valid solutions and explanatory near misses
POST http://localhost:5000/api/conflicts/{{conflict_id}}/solutions
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./conflict_solutions.json
